<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">两颗炽热的心 连通同一道心房</text><text for="L2">热血奔涌 曾如山洪般汹涌磅礴</text><text for="L3">你我本是血肉相连的躯体</text><text for="L4">两条各自的轨迹 融为同一种人生</text><text for="L5">勉力坚持 却仍让你失望</text><text for="L6">竭力去弥补与挽回</text><text for="L7">四季轮转 终有更迭</text><text for="L8">岁月洗礼 让人学会长大</text><text for="L9">世事变迁 总让人落泪 哭了又哭</text><text for="L10">世间万物不过是过眼云烟</text><text for="L11">一切终将悄然流逝</text><text for="L12">爱永不会消亡 永不会褪色 永不会止息</text><text for="L13">我深知</text><text for="L14">哦——</text><text for="L15">候鸟终究各自展翅 飞向不同的长空</text><text for="L16">呜——</text><text for="L17">但愿来日 还能与你重逢</text><text for="L18">日落日升 暮去朝来</text><text for="L19">活在梦中 看着枝叶轻轻飘落</text><text for="L20">染尽了季节的颜色</text><text for="L21">有些深夜 依然会不受控制地想起你</text><text for="L22">重温旧日时光 贪恋着温存若能停留</text><text for="L23">痴心期盼 沉溺于梦</text><text for="L24">岁月更替 寒暑易节</text><text for="L25">生活推着你我一步步成熟</text><text for="L26">生死离别 会让人变得越来越冷硬</text><text for="L27">聚散无常 繁华皆是暂歇</text><text for="L28">万事万物如沙般滑落消散</text><text for="L29">真爱不会死去 永不消逝 永不磨灭</text><text for="L30">我心里明白</text><text for="L31">哦——</text><text for="L32">飞鸟终究会各奔东西 迎风远走</text><text for="L33">呜——</text><text for="L34">多么盼望 在彼岸再度与你相遇</text><text for="L35">哦——</text><text for="L36">孤鸿天各一方 循着各自的宿命飞翔</text><text for="L37">呜——</text><text for="L38">那就尽情振翅高飞吧 飞向苍穹之巅</text><text for="L39">当孤月垂眸 俯瞰人间</text><text for="L40">将皎洁清辉洒向你脚下的土地</text><text for="L41">我正振翅冲入九霄 只为让你望见</text><text for="L42">你脚下投落的那道影子 正是我</text><text for="L43">我始终坚信</text><text for="L44">哦——</text><text for="L45">飞鸟纵然各有去向 渐行渐远</text><text for="L46">呜——</text><text for="L47">多希望有一天还能与你重逢</text><text for="L48">哦——</text><text for="L49">群鸟飞向天际各方 奔赴各自的浩渺</text><text for="L50">呜——</text><text for="L51">去高飞吧 飞向更高更远的远方</text><text for="L52">哦——</text><text for="L53">就这样飞高吧 再飞高一些</text><text for="L54">呜——</text><text for="L55">去展翅高飞吧 直至天际无垠</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="source"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Birds"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Imagine Dragons"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Origins (Deluxe Edition)"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1437949219"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71816168"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:16.750" end="3:34.360"><p begin="0:16.750" end="0:20.400" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.750" end="0:17.240">Two</span> <span begin="0:17.240" end="0:18.510">hearts,</span> <span begin="0:18.760" end="0:19.220">one</span> <span begin="0:19.220" end="0:20.400">valve</span></p><p begin="0:20.710" end="0:22.760" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.710" end="0:20.970">Pump</span><span begin="0:20.970" end="0:21.110">in'</span> <span begin="0:21.110" end="0:21.190">the</span> <span begin="0:21.190" end="0:21.760">blood,</span> <span begin="0:21.760" end="0:21.910">we</span> <span begin="0:21.910" end="0:22.050">were</span> <span begin="0:22.050" end="0:22.190">the</span> <span begin="0:22.190" end="0:22.760">flood</span></p><p begin="0:22.760" end="0:24.400" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.760" end="0:22.910">We</span> <span begin="0:22.910" end="0:23.060">were</span> <span begin="0:23.060" end="0:23.190">the</span> <span begin="0:23.190" end="0:23.590">bo</span><span begin="0:23.590" end="0:23.810">dy</span> <span begin="0:23.810" end="0:24.400">and</span></p><p begin="0:24.720" end="0:28.300" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.720" end="0:25.130">Two</span> <span begin="0:25.130" end="0:26.430">lives,</span> <span begin="0:26.750" end="0:27.110">one