y</span><span begin="0:40.630" end="0:41.000">thing</span> <span begin="0:41.000" end="0:41.190">is</span> <span begin="0:41.190" end="0:41.480">tem</span><span begin="0:41.480" end="0:41.710">po</span><span begin="0:41.710" end="0:42.030">rar</span><span begin="0:42.030" end="0:42.290">y</span></p><p begin="0:42.280" end="0:44.160" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.280" end="0:42.540">Eve</span><span begin="0:42.540" end="0:42.660">ry</span><span begin="0:42.660" end="0:42.980">thing</span> <span begin="0:42.980" end="0:43.120">will</span> <span begin="0:43.120" end="0:44.160">slide</span></p><p begin="0:44.160" end="0:47.493" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.160" end="0:44.510">Love</span> <span begin="0:44.510" end="0:44.670">will</span> <span begin="0:44.670" end="0:44.990">ne</span><span begin="0:44.990" end="0:45.100">ver</span> <span begin="0:45.100" end="0:46.269">die,</span> <span begin="0:46.269" end="0:47.232">die,</span> <span begin="0:47.232" end="0:47.493">die</span></p><p begin="0:47.310" end="0:48.310" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:47.310" end="0:47.650">I</span> <span begin="0:47.650" end="0:47.940">know</span> <span begin="0:47.940" end="0:48.310">that</span></p><p begin="0:48.320" end="0:52.032" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:48.320" end="0:52.032">Ooh</span></p><p begin="0:52.740" end="0:56.340" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:52.740" end="0:53.210">Birds</span> <span begin="0:53.210" end="0:54.090">fly</span> <span begin="0:54.090" end="0:54.280">in</span> <span begin="0:54.280" end="0:54.540">dif</span><span begin="0:54.540" end="0:54.550">fer</span><span begin="0:54.550" end="0:54.770">ent</span> <span begin="0:54.770" end="0:54.990">di</span><span begin="0:54.990" end="0:55.390">rec</span><span begin="0:55.390" end="0:56.340">tions</span></p><p begin="0:56.340" end="1:00.260" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:56.340" end="1:00.260">Ooh</span></p><p b